# Step 7: Acceptance on dev
- After merge + green deploy: run the page's manual/e2e cases (bugs: the issue criteria) + short smoke. One issue comment listing cases passed/failed by id.
- Failure: bug issue linking the case id; parent stays open / В работе. Do not close the parent issue.
- Passed: run step 8 if Doc- is required (read `TA: Doc- after merge`); then set `статус: готово` and close the issue in the same moment (board-sync moves the card to Готово; never leave a closed issue with another status label). A follow-up comment may note the merged PR; do not add late `closes`/`fix`/`fixes`. Feature: Готово when all subtasks are closed after their acceptance.
- The owner may spot-check major features; lead still owns the acceptance comment and the close.

## Wait-watch
- After merge, in the **same turn**, create a short-lived GitHub `ci-passed`/`ci-failed` routine on `main` (`ciBranch: main`) whose prompt requires workflow `Deploy to dev` for a head that includes the merge sha, then runs this step, then deletes itself. Mirror the wait in the lead pipeline note (OPS.md). Do not use cron. Arm-then-check: if Deploy is already green, accept now.
- When this issue's remaining criteria live on a sibling issue, keep both open until joint acceptance; close them together (`playbook-workflow.mdc` related acceptance).

